      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the comments.&nbsp; Adding a challenge to the Lieutenant is not nearly as powerful as making 1 guy the equivalent of 2 Lieutenants.&nbsp; The extra action was not the big point.&nbsp; The added durability was.</p>",
